<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32676" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπληκτ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>striking with consternation, astounding,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θόρυβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.92
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τοῖς ἐχθροῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
					8.18
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπληκτικώτερον</span>
			<i>more surprising</i> or <i>startling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1460b25
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				22.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				<i>terribly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					14.25
				</span></i>
			 : 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτατα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				11.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>with enthusiasm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδέξασθαί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.5.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
